# B in play (debug): every bot terminated at once, as if it had crashed. The status line says so
# and the round's won: the walls sink, you ride on, and the next round rises round you (5 s). B
# again skips that one too.
wait_boot # the game is up
skip_prologue # play, fresh at the start
wait 1.5
shot kill_0_before
press b
wait 0.6
shot kill_1_eliminated
wait 5.5
shot kill_2_round_2
press b
wait 6
shot kill_3_round_3
